    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classAstCycleTest" kindref="compound">AstCycleTest</ref> is based on the successor information of SgNodes (the same information that is used by the traversals). It tests such that it allows a preorder traversal to revisit nodes but reports an error if the traversal would run into a cycle. If a cycle is found it reports the list of SgNodes that are part of the cycle to stdout, starting with &quot;CYCLE FOUND: ...&quot; and stops testing. Usage: <ref refid="classAstCycleTest" kindref="compound">AstCycleTest</ref> t; t.traverse(SgNode* n); // where n is the root node of the subtree to be tested. </para>    </detaileddescription>
